Source: adaptation-samsung-beyond2lte
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: adaptation-samsung-beyond2lte
Architecture: all
Depends: adaptation-samsung-beyond2lte-configs (= ${binary:Version}),
         adaptation-samsung-beyond2lte-tools (>= ${binary:Version}),
         linux-bootimage-samsung-beyond2lte,
         linux-image-samsung-beyond2lte,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Droidian adaptation for the Samsung Galaxy S10+ (Exynos)
 Pulls in the kernel, the device configuration and the device tools for
 the Samsung Galaxy S10+ with the Exynos 9820 (SM-G975F, beyond2lte).

Package: adaptation-samsung-beyond2lte-configs
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-dbus, python3-gi, plymouth, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Droidian configuration for the Samsung Galaxy S10+ (Exynos)
 Device specific configuration for the Samsung Galaxy S10+ with the
 Exynos 9820 (SM-G975F, beyond2lte): device node permissions from the
 Android ueventd files, the vibrator node, the PulseAudio droid card
 options the Samsung audio HAL needs, the boot splash theme matching the
 S-Boot logo, automatic screen brightness, CPU touch boost and the KDE
 portal unit limited to Wayland sessions.

Package: adaptation-samsung-beyond2lte-tools
Architecture: arm64
Depends: wayfire, plasma-workspace (>= 4:6.7.4), plasma-workspace (<< 4:6.7.5),
         ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Droidian device tools for the Samsung Galaxy S10+ (Exynos)
 Prebuilt binaries for the Samsung Galaxy S10+ (beyond2lte):
  - plasma_session and ksplashqml from plasma-workspace 6.7.4 with the
    Droidian KDE_NO_KWIN patches (diverted over the Debian ones), so the
    Plasma session runs on the wayfire compositor,
  - the podglad wayfire plugin: window thumbnails for the task switcher,
    maximized windows kept at full size, volume keys for the camera.
